# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  CODEOWNERS — auto-route reviews by file ownership
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Order matters: later rules override earlier ones. Put broad rules first,
#  narrow exceptions last.
#
#  Format: <pattern>  <owner1>  <owner2>
#  Use @org/team or @username. For PURPCLAW, the agent divisions ARE the teams.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Default: codeowners team must approve everything ────────────────────────
*                                          @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-maintainers

# ── Infrastructure — CACTUS 🌵 ──────────────────────────────────────────────
/.github/                                  @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure
/Dockerfile*                               @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure
/docker-compose*                           @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure
/infra/                                    @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure
/deploy/                                   @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure
/scripts/                                  @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure
/install.sh                                @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure
/install.ps1                               @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure
/.dockerignore                             @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure
/ecosystem.config.js                       @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure
/.env.example                              @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure
/config.*                                  @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure
/config/                                   @weemadscotsman/purpclaw-infrastructure

